%% Same node/edge contract as architecture.svg.
flowchart TD
    INPUT["Hospital export boundary<br/>LIS / FHIR / CDS Hub → files/view<br/>TORCH/CQL or SQL selection upstream<br/>Explicit input + output selection"]
    CONFIG["TOML + secret references<br/>Map input / selected profile rules<br/>Choose local, API or both<br/>Enable sources; select editions<br/>Offline mode disables API calls"]
    NORMAL["Validate and standardise<br/>Codes + units + values + references<br/>Preserve versions/context; no rewrite"]
    GROUP["Embedded DuckDB grouping<br/>Distinct: complete guarded sets<br/>Known counts → mean/SE, median/IQR<br/>Items: retain ID / component path"]
    LOCAL["A · Local terminology<br/>Download once with package-init<br/>or install real JSON/CSV/SQLite<br/>Set lookup.path + systems<br/>Offline: add UCUM/LOINC pack<br/>Keep editions and file hashes"]
    API["B · API configuration<br/>Set type, endpoint + systems<br/>Credentials: .env / secret files<br/>NLM / LOINC / own FHIR<br/>network.mode = lookups<br/>Enabled APIs called at runtime"]
    CHECK["Same laboratory check kernel<br/>Source code / unit / reference checks<br/>Target profile systems and bindings<br/>LOINC axes / verified UCUM factors<br/>Preserve whole-set context<br/>Missing evidence → unverified"]
    RESEARCH["Separate evidence research<br/>Name search → exact candidates<br/>Cached per LOINC / edition<br/>PubMed + Europe PMC + pages<br/>Quoted values / units / ranges<br/>Exact prompts / query trace"]
    QC["Other MII quality checks<br/>FHIR Validator: conformance<br/>FDE: availability/completeness<br/>Separate scopes and outputs"]
    OUTPUT["Checked export and proposals<br/>CSV + HTML + summary + evidence<br/>Source and target checks separate<br/>Mapping + reference transformations<br/>Chained log + hashes + editions"]
    STUDY["Matched export studies<br/>LIS ↔ FHIR ↔ CDS Hub<br/>Groups + known frequencies<br/>Context changes / loss candidates"]
    REGISTRY["Scoped mapping registry<br/>Source + profile + set scope<br/>Recheck targets in later runs<br/>Retain history and revocation"]
    EXPERT["Laboratory physician review<br/>Decision + reviewer + time + evidence<br/>Apply/revalidate approved site plans"]
    INPUT --> NORMAL
    CONFIG --> NORMAL
    NORMAL --> GROUP
    CONFIG -.-> |"setup / path"| LOCAL
    CONFIG -.-> |"explicit selection"| API
    GROUP --> CHECK
    LOCAL --> |"local reads"| CHECK
    API --> |"selected API calls"| CHECK
    OUTPUT -.-> |"separate pass"| RESEARCH
    CHECK --> OUTPUT
    RESEARCH -.-> |"dossier"| EXPERT
    EXPERT --> |"decision"| REGISTRY
    REGISTRY -.-> |"scoped reuse"| CHECK
    OUTPUT --> STUDY
    OUTPUT --> EXPERT
    QC -.-> |"complementary"| EXPERT
    classDef normal fill:#f3f7fa,stroke:#c4d5df,color:#142d42
    class INPUT,CONFIG,NORMAL,GROUP,LOCAL,API,CHECK,QC,STUDY normal
    classDef teal fill:#eef7f4,stroke:#a8cfc6,color:#142d42
    class RESEARCH,OUTPUT,REGISTRY,EXPERT teal
    classDef error fill:#fcf1f3,stroke:#ecc7cf,color:#142d42
